# gallery's language switch has a whole language to show, and so a layout is
# seen to hold French. Nothing here is a decided wording.
#
# The demos' words in French: every phrase the demos write, keyed by the
# English it is written in where it is used (language.gd). The floor's own
# words are the floor's catalogue (words/fr.po) and are not repeated here.
# A look's name, a sight's and the coin's mark are data - shown as they are
# in every language - and so have no entry.
